  "bio": "Welcome to the artistic haven of Robert Egbert Tattoo Studio, where the rich heritage of Japanese tattooing meets the striking depth of black & gray styles. Our dedicated team, featuring the talents of @robertegberttattoo, @mikeburnside665, and @sammystormtattoo, is at your disposal seven days a week from 12 to 8 PM. Connect with us at loandbeholdtattoo@gmail.com to bring your visions to ink with unparalleled craftsmanship.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n360.943.9999 open at noon Friday-Tuesday \nloandbeholdtattoo@gmail.com \n@robertegberttattoo @camdentuttletattoos\n\n360.943.9999 open at noon Friday-Tuesday \nloandbeholdtattoo@gmail.com \n@robertegberttattoo @camdentuttletattoos",
